---
// Shared site footer — one copy, rendered by Layout.astro for every page.
//
// White ground, matching the header. Social icons are inline SVG rather than
// icon-font glyphs so the row survives a Font Awesome failure.
//
// Contact details here are the ones from PR #9 and #10 and must stay in step
// with the Organization/LocalBusiness JSON-LD in Layout.astro.
